            <div class="field field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><div class="bne-font-afacad--regular" style="color:#fff;text-shadow:#000000 1px 0 10px;"><h3 class="text-align-justify" style="color:#FFC47F;text-shadow:#000000 1px 0 10px;">MAKE THE STORY YOUR OWN</h3><div style="font-size:22px !important;"><p class="text-align-justify"><img alt width="936" height="12" class="twic" typeof="foaf:Image" data-twic-src="image:/high/dawnwalker/the-blood-of-dawnwalker/00-page-product/separator.png" data-twic-src-transform="cover/step=10/quality=80" style="object-fit: cover" loading="lazy" src="../../_external/p325k7wa.twic.pics/high/dawnwalker/the-blood-of-dawnwalker/00-page-product/separator__q7e93m9.png"></p><p class="text-align-justify">Experience and shape the plot the way you want. Embark on the quest to save your family, or swear revenge on your sire and destroy everyone standing in your way.</p><p class="text-align-justify">Discover ancient secrets lurking in the valley. Rush in head first or risk taking time to prepare.</p><p class="text-align-justify">Go alone or search for friends and forge unlikely alliances.</p></div></div></div>
      
